'''New World Ehen''' (新世界アリ＝エヘン, ''Shinsekai Ari-Ehen'', '''New World Ari-Ehen''') is the 5th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 103rd sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]] and is available up to {{2c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
A fairly easy sub-chapter compared to the previous ones. Only the [[So-So City Center|7th stage]] may cause you trouble, although without proper units, the [[Hole Lotta Somethin'|last stage]] might also be difficult.
{{LegendDiff|120}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 5 enemies to Zero Legends:

*[[Lophiiformes Angaburu]]: A [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Henry]]. A very different enemy overall, with no Long Distance, 1 less knockback, a quick attack rate, mediocre range and otherwise average stats, guaranteed Slow with moderate uptime, and a 75% chance to create a [[Surge Attack#Mini-Surge|Mini-Surge]] between 280 and 980 range. The only enemy completely new to this chapter.
*[[THE FOLIVOREAN]]: An [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[THE SLOTH]] that moves much faster, has a weak [[Shield]] and hits three times per attack, affecting a different range and potentially freezing units on each hit. Its immunity to [[Wave Attack|waves]] makes it harder to snipe.
*[[Suidae Piggicus]]: An [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/Behemoth variant of [[Pigge]]. One of the more balanced Behemoths overall, it mainly serves as a tank whose only impressive stats are health and attack rate. Occasionally freezes cats for 2 seconds.
*[[Divine Cyclone]]: A purely [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] that debuted in [[Oncoming Maelstrom (Expert)|Wrath of Heaven]]. Like most Cyclones, it has very low range but extreme damage and attack speed, letting it shred through units if it isn't stopped.
*[[Queen B]]: An Alien/Floating enemy introduced in [[Honey Trap (Deadly)|Queen's Coronation]]. Her ceaseless Long Distance attacks hit from extreme range, with high damage and full-uptime Slow (7.4 seconds), so anything caught in her AOE is a lost cause. Fortunately, her large blindspot means she isn't really a threat unless backed by other enemies that cover it.

